    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Garrett O Bric Property Advisors are delighted to present this exceptionally spacious and bright two bed second floor apartment set within a gated community in the heart of Shankill Village with all amenities and services virtually on your doorstep. This wonderful home boasts almost 70 square metres of well designed accommodation with an abundance of natural light along with fabulous open aspect with views of a woodland setting. This sale provides a superb opportunity to acquire a stylish and comfortable home set in a sought after and well connected location with excellent public transport links close at hand. Having just undergone a complete refurbishment the property is presented for sale in turn key condition and is finished to a high specification throughout. The layout is both generous and practical, perfect for modern living, the open plan living, dining and kitchen is a standout space, beautifully proportioned and enhanced by a wonderful picture window overlooking the woodlands, bringing the outside inside while the kitchen has been upgraded with a stunning custom built fitted kitchen complete with high quality integrated appliances. This lively bustling village is home to an abundance of local shops plus Tesco and Lidl, schools and churches. The stunning Shanganagh Park is close at hand with its wonderful playing fields, soccer and GAA pitches plus a super playground. The sea is just a mile away providing opportunities for water sports and sea swimming. For commuters the area boasts excellent infrastructure with Dublin Bus, DART and mainline rail services all close at hand. This exceptional apartment offers the perfect blend of modern living, spacious accommodation and enviable convenience and early viewing is strongly recommended to appreciate all this home has to offer. \n\n\nFeatures Include\nRecently Upgraded Throughout \nStunning New Fitted Kitchen \nWarm Oak Laminate Timber Flows Seamlessly Throughout \nGas Fired Central Heating System \nSuper Energy Efficient B BER Rating \nSecure Second Floor Location\nBoast Wonderful Slyvan Setting Within Landscaped Grounds \nDesignated Parking \nSecure Setting Beyond Electric Gates\nLift Access\nIntercom System\nAccommodation Extending to 67.17 square metres \n\n\nAccommodation\n\nFoyer with post boxes and lift access to the first floor. \n\nEntrance Hallway \nWelcoming approach via a bright inviting hallway, here a walk in hotpress provides ample linen storage while a further storage area keeps the hallway clutter free. Wonderful warm oak laminate timber flooring flows seamlessly throughout the property adding to the sense of space and reflecting the light while been easily maintained. \n\nKitchen Diner Living Room\n9.2 x 3.1m \nThis is a stand out living space drenched in natural light with ample room for designated cooking, dining and living room areas. A walk in box bay window provides the perfect space for your dining table. The kitchen area is truly special and is home to a brand new bespoke fitted kitchen in stunning sage green with brass fittings offering plenty of storage, the kitchen is complete with built in oven, hob and extractor fan, integrated fridge freezer and dishwasher, the splash back is tiled for ease of maintenance. \n\nPrimary Bedroom \n4 x 2.7m \nDouble bedroom with built in wardrobes providing excellent storage plus an ensuite shower room with sanitary in classic white paired with a corner shower with glazed screen door, the room is complete with attractive wall panelling and tiling. \n\nBedroom No. 2\n4.4 x 2.5m \nAgain this double bedroom features a range of fitted wardrobes. \n\nBathroom\nThis stylish bathroom features high quality sanitary ware in white including wc, wash hand basin with vanity unit below providing excellent storage, and a bath with shower facility above. The room features extensive tiling in a timeless black and white colour scheme. \n\nOutside: \nThe complex is set in wonderful landscaped grounds with designated underground parking. \n\n\nPrice Euro 395,000\n\nEircode D18 HY10\n\nBER Rating B\n\nBER Number 106900442\n\nAnnual Management Fee - ?3,200\n\nDisclaimer\nWhilst care has been taken in the preparation of this property listing, the information contained herein is provided for general guidance only and does not constitute any part of an offer or contract. All descriptions, dimensions, photographs, maps, floor plans, references to condition, and other details are provided in good faith but without responsibility. Measurements are approximate and any areas, boundaries, or outlines shown on maps or plans are for identification purposes only.\nProspective purchasers or tenants must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy and completeness of all information, including measurements, boundaries, fixtures, fittings, planning permissions, services, and condition, by inspection or other appropriate means.\nThe agent has not tested any apparatus, equipment, fixtures, fittings, or services and cannot warrant that these are in working order or fit for purpose.\nNo representation or warranty, express or implied, is made as to the accuracy or completeness of the information provided, and no liability is accepted for any loss arising from reliance thereon.\n\nServices \nAll Mains Services "
      },
